ENTERPRISE DOMAIN MODEL (EDM)

Smart Property

Enterprise PropTech Ecosystem

Version 1.0

Prepared For:
Aviritech

---

1. Purpose

The Enterprise Domain Model (EDM) defines the core business domains, entities, relationships, and ownership boundaries for Smart Property.

Each domain encapsulates a specific area of business responsibility and communicates with other domains through well-defined interfaces.

---

2. Domain Map

The Smart Property ecosystem is composed of the following bounded contexts:

1. Identity & Access
2. Organization Management
3. Property Management
4. GIS & Survey
5. Smart Trust™
6. Blockchain Registry
7. Document Management
8. BIM Management
9. Booking & Reservations
10. Rental Management
11. Property Sales
12. Tokenized Investment
13. Finance & Smart Wallet™
14. Vendor Marketplace
15. Estate Management
16. Bills & Utilities
17. Notifications
18. Reporting & Analytics
19. Workflow Engine
20. Audit & Compliance

---

3. Domain Details

Domain 1 — Identity & Access

Purpose

Manage authentication, authorization, users, roles, permissions, and identity.

Primary Entities

- User
- Role
- Permission
- UserRole
- Session
- Device
- APIKey (future)

Relationships

- One User can have many Roles.
- One Role has many Permissions.
- Clerk Authentication maps to a User profile using "clerkId".

---

Domain 2 — Organization Management

Purpose

Support companies and teams operating on the platform.

Entities

- Organization
- Branch
- Department
- Team
- StaffMember

This enables agencies, estate developers, law firms, surveying firms, and vendor companies to operate under a single organization.

---

Domain 3 — Property Management

Purpose

Manage all real estate assets.

Entities

- Estate
- Block
- Property
- PropertyUnit
- PropertyCategory
- PropertyType
- Amenity
- PropertyMedia
- PropertyVideo
- PropertyFeature

Relationships

- One Estate contains many Blocks.
- One Block contains many Properties.
- One Property can contain many Units.
- One Property has many Media assets.
- One Property is owned by one or more Owners (allowing co-ownership).

---

Domain 4 — GIS & Survey

Purpose

Capture and manage geographical information.

Entities

- Survey
- SurveyPlan
- PropertyBoundary
- Coordinate
- GeoLocation
- Parcel
- Landmark

Capabilities

- Polygon boundaries
- GeoJSON
- KML/KMZ
- CSV import
- GPS capture
- Area calculation

A Property is linked to one or more PropertyBoundary records representing its land parcel.

---

Domain 5 — Smart Trust™

Purpose

Provide a trusted property verification process.

Entities

- VerificationRequest
- VerificationStage
- Inspection
- LegalReview
- Valuation
- TrustScore
- TrustCertificate

Workflow

Property → Verification → Survey Check → Inspection → Valuation → Legal Review → Approval → Blockchain Registration → Trust Certificate.

---

Domain 6 — Blockchain Registry

Purpose

Provide tamper-evident proof of verified property records.

Entities

- BlockchainRecord
- Transaction
- DocumentHash
- PropertyHash
- CertificateHash
- SmartContract

Relationships

- Each TrustCertificate references one BlockchainRecord.
- BlockchainRecord stores hashes and metadata, while the original documents remain in secure storage.

---

