4. Core Relationships

- A User may belong to one or more Organizations.
- A Property belongs to an Estate (optional).
- A Property has one or more Owners.
- A Property has one assigned Agent at a time.
- A Property has many Documents.
- A Property has many Media assets.
- A Property has one or more GIS Boundaries.
- A Property may have one or more BIM Models.
- A Property may have one active Trust Certificate.
- A Trust Certificate references a Blockchain Record.
- A Booking records the Agent assigned at booking time.
- A Vendor provides one or more Services.
- A Wallet belongs to one User.
- A Payment may relate to a Booking, Bill, Sale, Lease, Vendor Service, or Token Purchase.
- Every critical action generates an Audit Log entry.

